Andreas Dorn <adornno1@web.de> writes:
> > Janis Papanagnou <Janis_Papanagnou@hotmail.com> wrote in news:ck960i$vgq$1
> > @online.de:

> >> losehp(rnd(2+*range), "touching the edge of the universe",
